# ghost.rc: `ask`, the line client, against the ghost and the stub model
# the boot self-test runs, docs/GHOST.md section 4. The answer streams to
# the terminal, which here is the backquote. The exit word is `ok` or what
# came back instead.
x=`{ask -w /n/remote say hello}
if(! ~ $"x 'hello, person') exit 'ask said '^$"x
exit ok
